{"about_the_game":"<strong>Brain Show: Ready for a taste of the madness?</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623260/extras/CHOOSE_CHARACTER.gif?t=1747311371\" /><br><br><strong>Brain Show DEMO</strong> lets you step into a chaotic quiz show experience \u2013 just enough to get you hooked! Test your brainpower, challenge your friends, and meet our charmingly annoying host.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623260/extras/QUESTION.gif?t=1747311371\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with up to 8 players<br></li><li>Try a slice of our massive question pool<br></li><li>Experience a few unique competitions<br></li><li>Meet the host \u2013 funny, cringy, and always ready with a comment<br></li><li>Perfect party starter \u2013 no gaming experience required!<br></li><li>Online multiplayer preview</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623260/extras/COMPETITIONS.gif?t=1747311371\" /><br><br>Controls in <strong>Brain Show DEMO</strong> are so simple, even our test subjects (a slightly grumpy cat and a hyper chihuahua) nailed it. Grab some friends, hand them controllers, and you're ready to roll \u2013 no manual, no fuss!<br><br>Try out the show, face off in crazy challenges like <strong>Stealing Points</strong> or <strong>Eliminations</strong>, and get a feel for what it\u2019s like to battle brains in front of a virtual audience.<br><br><strong>Download the DEMO</strong> and see if you have what it takes to be the star of <strong>Brain Show</strong>!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623260?t=1747311371","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623260/01817f9cc83fdbc8db2ec5568b6a99e207cde2e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747311371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst